  "question": {
    "en": "How much total time does your child spend sleeping during the DAY (between when your child wakes for the day and goes to bed at night)?  Example: If your child took 2 naps and slept 1 hour each time, your child's total time spent sleeping during the day is 2 hours (Hours napping: 2; Minutes napping: 0).Hours napping: {ph_cg_bisq_005_i_01}Minutes napping: {ph_cg_bisq_005_i_02}"
  },
